// RETITLED + RE-FRAMED 2026-07-29. This page was "How your Bitcoin actually works,"
// labelled OPTIONAL, and it opened by telling the reader they didn't need to read
// it. That was true when it was a side-trip off an action-first site. It is now
// lesson 2 of a linear course — the page the site is named after — so the optional
// framing had to go. It briefly absorbed hot-vs-cold as §6 (2026-07-29) — that left
// again on 2026-07-30 to /learn/hot-and-cold, which reunites the definition with the
